<h3>Apple CarPlay Just Got Three Popular iPhone Apps</h3><br/>
Apple's CarPlay system for accessing iPhone apps on a vehicle's dashboard screen <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/04/apple-carplay-just-got-three-popular-iphone-apps/">received three popular apps last week</a>: ChatGPT, Google Meet, and Audiomack.<br/>
<br/>
<div class="center-wrap"><img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/02/Aston-Martin-CarPlay-Ultra-Screen.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1034779" /><em><a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2025/05/15/first-look-at-carplay-ultra/">CarPlay Ultra</a> in an Aston Martin</em></div><br/>
In addition, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/07/whatsapp-gets-new-carplay-app/">WhatsApp released a revamped CarPlay app</a> that improves upon the basic Siri-based functionality that was previously available, offering full access to recent chats and call history, favorite contacts, and more.<br/>
<br/>
<h3>iOS 26.4.1 Includes These Two Changes for iPhones</h3><br/>
After we <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/06/ios-26-4-1-coming-soon/">spotted signs of it</a> in our site analytics earlier this week, Apple <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/08/apple-releases-ios-26-4-1/">released iOS and iPadOS 26.4.1</a> on Wednesday. The update <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/08/ios-26-4-1-has-two-changes-for-iphones/">includes a fix for an iOS 26.4 bug affecting iCloud syncing</a>, and it also turns on Stolen Device Protection by default for additional users.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/04/iOS-26.4.1-Feature-1.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1044037" /><br/>
Apple followed that up with a <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/09/apple-releases-macos-tahoe-26-4-1/">macOS 26.4.1 update</a> on Thursday that includes a fix for a Wi-Fi issue on the new M5 MacBook Air and M5 Pro and M5 Max MacBook Pro models.<br/>
<br/>
